# Silicon Labs Project Configuration Tools: slcp, v0, Component selection file.
project_name: siwg917_ip_blocker
label: siwg917_ip_blocker
description: "Start a Wi-Fi client and transmits/receives data to measure WLAN UDP/TCP/TLS\
